{
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "...You smell of a heart that stopped.",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "It stopped. It beats again now.",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "Then take a blessing of mine. I do not know who waits for you below.",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.1-0.ancient": "Back again. Whose soul walks with you this time?",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.1-0.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.1-1.char": "I won't know until the film rolls.",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "However many times you die, you come back, nameless child.",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "There are still people in the seats.",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "...Then rise again.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.0-0r.char": "Are there seats at the top of this spire too?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.0-1r.ancient": "Nameless one. My spire keeps no audience. Only climbers.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.1-0.char": "I climbed again. With a different soul this time.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.1-1.ancient": "One who climbs while changing souls. Strange.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.1-2.char": "Not changing. Walking together.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "I hear your heart beating twice.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "Yes. One of them is not mine.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.3-0.char": "This time I'll run the reel to the end.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.3-1.ancient": "A reel that reaches its end does not turn again.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.3-2.char": "That's why I'm going to the end.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.4-0.ancient": "One who died and returned. Do you mean to die again atop my spire?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.4-1.char": "Once was enough.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.4-2.ancient": "...Then endure.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.5-0.char": "At the summit, the soul inside me went quiet.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.5-1.ancient": "Out of fear, no doubt.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.5-2.char": "No. It remembers its own last battle.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.6-0r.ancient": "Back again. Whose soul is it this time?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.6-1r.char": "Whoever it is, we'll cross the last second together.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.6-2r.ancient": "Then prove it.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.7-0r.char": "Should I leave a reel of film in this spire?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.7-1r.ancient": "My spire is no projection room.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.7-2r.char": "The underworld said the same.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.8-0r.ancient": "Borrow as many souls as you like; the spire still has one summit.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.8-1r.char": "Then the two of us will go to that summit.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.8-2r.ancient": "...Come.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.1-0.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MUMYEONG-MUMYEONG_CHARACTER.1-1.next": "Continue",
